      "widgets_values": [
        "summary:\nA single locked-off panoramic shot animating the reference premium sci-fi esports stadium. Preserve the dark titanium circular arena, rigid geometry and exact camera composition. Broad cyan, royal blue and amethyst architectural ring lights breathe slowly, with sweeping volumetric spotlights and fine atmospheric particles. Ambient website background.\n\ndetailed_description:\n[Shot 1] Static tripod camera, no translation, zoom, orbit, shake or cuts. The empty polished dark titanium arena stays perfectly stationary. Wide recessed cyan and royal blue ring lights pulse smoothly brighter then dimmer. Two broad violet beams slowly sweep distant upper stadium tiers. Fine silver motes drift above the arena floor in thin haze. Polished metal reflects the changing blue and amethyst illumination. A restrained champagne-gold pulse flows along the outer rim then recedes. Lighting has no abrupt flash and ends near the opening intensity. Keep the center dark and empty for interface overlays. Expensive realistic industrial design, cinematic controlled bloom, no rainbow chrome. No people, characters, robots, text, labels, logos, UI, explosions, fire or lightning. All motion is lighting or atmosphere; the stadium never moves or changes shape.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nN/A\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A",
        1344,
        768,
        73
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
